oer_state.db — state copyright, educational-reproduction basis (NOT Creative Commons)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

NY Regents — New York State Education Department (https://www.nysedregents.org)
  Released Regents examination questions (Algebra I / Geometry / Algebra II).
MCAS — Massachusetts Dept. of Elementary & Secondary Education (https://mcas.cognia.org)
  Released MCAS items (grades 3-8, 10).

  These items are state copyright. Both agencies publish past exams and release
  them for educational reproduction; this project indexes them on that basis for
  a non-commercial, educational grounding use. This is a good-faith educational-
  use position, NOT a Creative Commons grant or a transfer of rights. The
  content is partitioned into this separate database and is OPT-IN
  (`--with-state`), so any deployment can exclude it entirely. If a rights
  holder objects, open an issue and the affected content will be removed.


