Note for commercial use
-----------------------
Only oer_core.db (CC BY / public domain) is suitable for commercial reuse, with
attribution. oer_ncsa.db is NON-COMMERCIAL (CC BY-NC-SA). oer_state.db and
oer_ap.db are NOT Creative Commons and are indexed under an educational-use
rationale only — do not use them commercially. If you build a commercial
product, install core only (the default) or review each source's terms
independently.

CK-12 was evaluated and NOT included (see docs/spikes/S4-ck12.md).
